control: Each page of a run takes the active policy
removes: the first pass's composition hands it the account's policy taken once at the run's start, so a policy edit reaches the pages it stores only at the next run, while the second pass is still handed the active one at each page
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill
tests: TestEachPageOfTheFirstPassTakesTheActivePolicy
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

